1vf5|n|A broad, flat, wooden bar; a slat or sloat. ; A bolt or bar for fastening a door. ; A narrow depression, perforation, or aperture; esp., one for the reception of a piece fitting or sliding in it. ; The track of a deer; hence, a track of any kind.	a:8qq,43,2;22q2,30,3;15bd,25,4;t96,16,1;1ru6,3,2~15bd,25,4;22q2,30,3;1ru6,3,2;8qq,43,2;t96,16,1	n:19s2,60,4;arv,60,5;mbf,60,4;1xrc,54,6;1whz,45,4;26hk,43,3;1lc4,43,3;8qq,33,1;qul,25,4;22q2,24,2~22cu,21,12;1xrc,54,6;arv,60,5;1whz,45,4;mbf,60,4;qul,25,4;19s2,60,4;26hk,43,3;1lc4,43,3;5kv,14,2
